{
  "key": "letter-155-part-02",
  "number": 155,
  "generationId": "01a1e6f4-879f-7bd3-ba5c-ff251d0d52f2",
  "voice": "Views",
  "speed": 0.9,
  "clips": [
    {
      "index": 10,
      "text": "If you put the blame on circumstances, you will not be able to penetrate the roots of your own mental state.",
      "path": "audio/1970-155/11.mp3",
      "start": 0.0,
      "end": 6.36263
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "text": "Hence, whatever the situation, proceed to discover its causes in yourself.",
      "path": "audio/1970-155/12.mp3",
      "start": 7.840884,
      "end": 13.643447
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "text": "Causes are always in one's own self But they always appear to be in others.",
      "path": "audio/1970-155/13.mp3",
      "start": 15.035102,
      "end": 20.213333000000002
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "text": "Avoid this mistake and it will be difficult to preserve your unhappiness.",
      "path": "audio/1970-155/14.mp3",
      "start": 21.601723,
      "end": 25.48932
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "text": "Others function only as mirrors.",
      "path": "audio/1970-155/15.mp3",
      "start": 26.761405999999997,
      "end": 28.748231
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "text": "The face seen is always our own.",
      "path": "audio/1970-155/16.mp3",
      "start": 30.024058999999998,
      "end": 32.215101999999995
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "text": "Life can become a celebration.",
      "path": "audio/1970-155/17.mp3",
      "start": 33.359161,
      "end": 35.16229
    },
    {
      "index": 17,
      "text": "But it is necessary to create oneself anew.",
      "path": "audio/1970-155/18.mp3",
      "start": 36.42288,
      "end": 39.09068
    },
    {
      "index": 18,
      "text": "And that is not a difficult thing.",
      "path": "audio/1970-155/19.mp3",
      "start": 40.623333,
      "end": 42.882653
    },
    {
      "index": 19,
      "text": "Because in the very seeing of the fault in one's own vision the mistakes start dying and the birth of a new person begins.",
      "path": "audio/1970-155/20.mp3",
      "start": 44.356009,
      "end": 52.48
    }
  ]
}
